    <!-- Help Activity -->
    <string name="help_title">Application Guide &amp; Instructions</string>
    <string name="help_subtitle">Comprehensive usage guide and tips for AI Reply Assist</string>
    <string name="help_sec1_title">1. Initial Setup &amp; API Key</string>
    <string name="help_sec1_body">To start using the app, navigate to the Settings tab and enter your Google AI Studio Gemini API key. Click \"Save &amp; Verify\" to validate connectivity. Your key is securely encrypted using hardware-backed AES256-GCM encryption.</string>
    <string name="help_sec2_title">2. Notification Interception &amp; Quick Reply</string>
    <string name="help_sec2_body">Enable the Notification Listener Service in Android Settings. When messages arrive from WhatsApp, Telegram, Google Messages, or Signal, the app intercepts them, tracks conversation context, and generates smart replies.</string>
    <string name="help_sec3_title">3. Blacklist Filtering &amp; Privacy Shield</string>
    <string name="help_sec3_body">The Blacklist automatically blocks sensitive incoming messages (e.g. OTPs, passwords, bank verification codes) from reaching the AI. You can add custom keywords and test phrases in the Blacklist tab.</string>
    <string name="help_sec4_title">4. Background Execution &amp; Battery Saver</string>
    <string name="help_sec4_body">Keep the Foreground Service enabled to prevent Android from closing the app. Request Battery Optimization Exemption in Settings for uninterrupted background performance.</string>
    <string name="help_sec5_title">5. AI Personas &amp; Custom Prompts</string>
    <string name="help_sec5_body">Configure your reply tone in the AI Behavior tab. Choose from Professional, Casual, Ultra Concise, Customer Support, or write your own custom system instructions.</string>
    <string name="help_btn_close">Return to App</string>

